      en: ["Founded in 1866 by the Ottomans as a military outpost.", "Administrative capital of the Maysan Governorate in SE Iraq.", "Historical center for the Mandaean silversmithing craft.", "Located on the left bank of the Tigris River.", "Population is estimated to exceed 500,000 residents.", "Strategic location near the border with Iran."],
